\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Global Markets News of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 692 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 2015\par 16:02\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par TOP STORIES \par  \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CHINA INTERVENES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  TO SUPPORT TUMBLING YUAN \par  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to prop up the yuan, just a day after it had let it decline sharply, underscoring the tricky balancing act now facing its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par U.S. STOCKS TUMBLE AGAIN ON CHINA WORRIES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. stocks opened sharply lower for a second day as investors continued to worry about the pace of growth in China. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 AT&T\f28 \uc2 \f2  GIVES GUIDANCE FOR \f28 \uc2 \f2 DIRECTV\f28 \uc2 \f2  ERA \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 AT&T\f28 \uc2 \f2  laid out guidance through 2018 ahead of a conference with analysts, giving a peek at what its financials will look like following its tie-up with \f28 \uc2 \f2 DirecTV\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HEWLETT-PACKARD\f28 \uc2 \f2  NAMES POST-BREAKUP BOARD MEMBERS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hewlett-Packard Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 . on Wednesday named current and former executives at companies like \f28 \uc2 \f2 General Motors Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 . and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Comcast Corp\f28 \uc2 \f2 . to sit on the boards of the two companies it will split into in November \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MACY'S\f28 \uc2 \f2  CUTS GUIDANCE AS SALES, PROFIT SLIDE \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Macy's\f28 \uc2 \f2  cut its sales guidance for the year after reporting steeper-than-expected slides in sales and profit in its second quarter. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par KRAFT HEINZ TO SLASH 2,500 JOBS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Kraft Heinz said it will cut 2,500 jobs, including 700 at its Illinois headquarters, as it begins the process of integrating after its merger. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par INDIA REPORTS UPBEAT INFLATION,  PRODUCTION DATA \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India reported a greater-than-expected slowdown in inflation and an acceleration in industrial production, indicating gathering strength in the economy. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par ALIBABA REVENUE DISAPPOINTS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Alibaba reported a softer-than-expected 28% increase in revenue in its latest quarter, and the Chinese e-commerce giant said it has authorized a $4 billion stock-buyback program. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par DUDLEY: MONETARY POLICY ALONE CAN'T SOLVE LABOR MARKET STRUCTURAL IMBALANCES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve Bank of New York President \f28 \uc2 \f2 William Dudley\f28 \uc2 \f2  on Wednesday highlighted structural imbalances in the labor market, saying they cannot be resolved with monetary policy alone. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par FIS TO BUY FINANCIAL-TECH FIRM SUNGARD \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fidelity National agreed to buy financial software company \f28 \uc2 \f2 SunGard\f28 \uc2 \f2  for $9.1 billion, including the assumption of debt, ending its plans to go public. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par  \par  \par    ======== DOW JONES NEWSWIRES ANALYSIS AND COMMENTARY ======== \par  \par Asia News \par CHINA'S NEIGHBORS FEEL PAIN OF YUAN DEVALUATION \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The blowback from the China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  devaluation is being felt most directly in the financial markets on the country's periphery, where governments and central banks scrambled to respond. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Moneybeat Blog \par IS \f28 \uc2 \f2 GOOGLE\f28 \uc2 \f2  REALLY BECOMING THE '\f28 \uc2 \f2 BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY\f28 \uc2 \f2  OF THE INTERNET'? \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Google\f28 \uc2 \f2  is undergoing a massive restructuring that has it embracing the conglomerate model. But is it fair to compare it to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Warren Buffett\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Berkshire Hathaway\f28 \uc2 \f2 ? We can see the arguments for both "yes" and "no." \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Wealth Management Journal \par HELPING AN \f28 \uc2 \f2 NFL\f28 \uc2 \f2  DRAFT PICK START ON THE RIGHT FINANCIAL FOOT \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The 21-year-old client had signed a $2 million contract, but had received only a small part of that upfront, notes adviser Layton Cox. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Technology \par CHINA CYBERSECURITY FEARS PROMPT BUSINESS GROUPS TO PRESS OBAMA \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 American business and technology groups have asked President Obama to urge Beijing not to use cybersecurity measures to protect its domestic technology industry from foreign competition. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par   ============ MARKETS ACTION ============ \par  \par U.S. STOCKS TUMBLE AGAIN ON CHINA WORRIES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. stocks opened sharply lower for a second day as investors continued to worry about the pace of growth in China. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. GOVERNMENT\f28 \uc2 \f2  BOND YIELDS PLUNGE \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. government\f28 \uc2 \f2  bonds strengthened Wednesday, sending the yield on the benchmark 10-year note to the lowest level in more than three months, as concerns over China boosted demand for haven assets. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par DOLLAR FALLS AS YUAN MOVE CLOUDS FED OUTLOOK \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar tumbled against the euro and yen as the outlook for tighter Fed policy gets murkier for investors. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par OIL PRICES REBOUND ON RISING DEMAND \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Oil prices rose on signs of stronger global demand for crude, with U.S. futures rebounding from a six-year low reached in the previous session. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par GOLD RECOVERS AS YUAN-STRUCK INVESTORS SEEK SAFE HAVEN \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 After breaking below the $1,100 barrier immediately following Tuesday's devaluation of the yuan, the price of gold climbed to a three-week high Wednesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 August 12, 2015 10:02 ET (14:02 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150812eb8c001z5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
